{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04322","headline":"苦寒行 · 乔知之","name":"苦寒行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"胡天夜清迥，孤云独飘扬。\n遥裔出鴈关，逶迤含晶光。\n阴陵久裴回，幽都无多阳。\n初寒冻巨海，杀气流大荒。\n朔马饮寒冰，行子履胡霜。\n路有从役倦，卧死黄沙场。\n羁旅因相依，恸之泪沾裳。\n由来从军行，赏存不赏亡。\n亡者诚已矣，徒令存者伤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"乔知之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04322.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04322","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}